    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      243.52,
      518.89,
      284.4
    ],
    "text": "The Western Province North Crime Division commenced investigations into the shooting and killing of a person during a party held in the Kadirana Palliyawatta area within the Wattala Police Division on 23 July 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      298.96,
      520.06,
      339.84
    ],
    "text": "Accordingly, a team of officers attached to the Division arrested a suspect on the evening of 29 July 2026 in the Mukalangamuwa area of the Seeduwa Police Division for allegedly assisting and facilitating the commission of the crime.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      354.4,
      515.42,
      395.28
    ],
    "text": "Investigations have revealed that the suspect had transferred money from his bank account to arrange the rental of the car used by the suspects who arrived at the scene of the crime.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      409.74,
      479.38,
      423.02
    ],
    "text": "The arrested suspect is a 24-year-old resident of Mukalangamuwa, Seeduwa.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
