  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      126.61,
      502.05,
      167.49
    ],
    "text": "On the evening of 29 July 2026, a team of officers attached to the Moronthuduwa Police Station conducted a raid in the Mawala Thotupala area within the Moronthuduwa Police Division based on a tip-off.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      182.05,
      507.95,
      209.13
    ],
    "text": "During the operation, a suspect was arrested while in possession of 1,850 litres (10 barrels) of \"Goda,\" a liquid substance used in the production of illicit liquor.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      223.57,
      435.94,
      236.85
    ],
    "text": "The arrested suspect is a 40-year-old resident of the Wadduwa area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      251.44,
      497.74,
      264.72
    ],
    "text": "Further investigations are being conducted by the Moronthuduwa Police Station.",
    "fonts": [
