    "text": "On the evening of 29 July 2026, a motorcycle travelling towards Pulmude along the Pulmude\u2013Trincomalee Road near Arpath Junction within the Pulmude Police Division veered off the road after the rider lost control and collided with a culvert.",
    "fonts": [
